        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Todd Field, Zoltan Korda, Jane Adams\n- Films: Little Children, Happiness, Wonder Boys, Eternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mind\n- Roles: actor, filmmaker, screenwriter, director, producer\n\nFacts:\n- Zoltan Korda was born on June 3, 1895, and was a Hungarian-born motion picture screenwriter, director, and producer.\n- Jane Adams appeared in the film \"Happiness\" in 1998.\n- Jane Adams appeared in the film \"Wonder Boys\" in 2000.\n- Jane Adams appeared in the film \"Eternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mind\" in 2004.\n- Todd Field was born on February 24, 1964, and is an American actor and three-time Academy Award nominated filmmaker.\n- \"Little Children\" is a 2006 American drama film directed by Todd Field.\n- Jane Adams appeared in the film \"Little Children\" in 2006.\n- Zoltan Korda died on October 13, 1961.",
